The next London roguelike meet will be at 14:00 on Saturday 24 March
in the Pembury Tavern (http://www.individualpubs.co.uk/pembury/).  We
plan to (e)at, (q)uaff and #chat about roguelikes and related topics.
Look for people who are either wearing Nethack T-shirts, or just
looking generally geek-like.

To Nethackers: please note the change of date.

To non-Nethackers: this bimonthly meeting was formerly known as the
London rgrn, but as we often end up discussing other roguelikes, we
decided to try calling it a roguelike meet and see who might want to
come from the other roguelike newsgroups.
